# SYNTHETIC (Phase 3 T3). 429 Too Many Requests with X-Rate-Limit-* + Retry-After
# headers modeled on aggregators.md §4 [LIVE] polite-pool observation
# (X-Rate-Limit-Limit:10 / Interval:1s). HttpClient maps 429 -> rate_limited
# (Retry-After -> detail retry_after_s). Headers ride with body per §5.1 fixture ③.
HTTP-STATUS: 429
Content-Type: application/json
Retry-After: 5
X-Rate-Limit-Limit: 10
X-Rate-Limit-Interval: 1s

{"status":"error","message-type":"exception","message":"rate limit exceeded"}
